  "body": "You know those homes that just make sense?\r\nThis could be one of them.\r\nSet proudly on a generous 780 sqm (more or less) freehold site in a quiet cul-de-sac, this classic brick and tile home offers space, flexibility and easy coastal living - with Fisherman's Cove beach right across the road.\r\nAnd then there's the standout extra…\r\nA purpose-built legal home office with its own bathroom and kitchenette.\r\nIt's the kind of addition that can genuinely change the way you live - giving you separation between work and family life without sacrificing valuable space in the main home.\r\nWhether it's for a home-based business, working from home, guests or extended family, the possibilities are impressive.\r\nThe main home offers a generous 228 sqm floor area, with open-plan kitchen, dining and living at its heart, plus a separate lounge and office. Four spacious bedrooms include a master with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, complemented by a family bathroom.\r\nThe carpeted internal double garage comes complete with a workbench/bar area - perfect for the DIYer, hobbyist or anyone needing extra space for the toys.\r\nOutside, the generous patio flows naturally from the home, creating an inviting space for morning coffees, summer barbecues and relaxed entertaining. The fully fenced backyard gives the kids and pets room to play, while excellent off-street parking provides space for the boat, motorhome and more.\r\nAnd when it comes to lifestyle, the location is hard to beat.\r\nWith Fisherman's Cove practically on your doorstep, plus Gulf Harbour Marina, Whangaparaoa Golf Course and the beaches and walking trails of Shakespear Regional Park all nearby, there's plenty to enjoy.\r\nFamilies will appreciate being in zone for Gulf Harbour School and Whangaparaoa College, with Wentworth Primary and Wentworth College also within easy reach.\r\nSpace to live. Space to work. Space to entertain. And the coast right across the road.\r\nHomes offering this much flexibility in such a great location don't come along often.\r\nThe property is vacant so no time to wait.\r\nCome and see why this one just makes sense.",
